  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 41 C 12 A 6 D 5 B 2 = ?\n\nNow, if ‘A’ = ‘÷’, ‘B’ = ‘×’, ‘C’ = ‘+’ and ‘D’ = ‘−’, then:\n\n⇒ 41 + 12 ÷ 6 − 5 × 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 41 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ − __**5 × 2**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 41 + __**2**__ − __**10**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**41 + 2**__ − 10 = ?\n\n⇒ __**43 − 10**__ = __**33**__.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
